Auth / SigV4 example / auth: the awsv4 authentication cannot be exported
Auth / OAuth 1.0 example / auth: the oauth1 authentication cannot be exported
Auth / NTLM example: GET /get has the same method and path as Auth / OAuth 1.0 example; this request was left out
GraphQL / Get user / body: the GraphQL query and variables are not described; the operation has no request body
collection / assertions: 11 items have assertions; OpenAPI has no place for them
